  "details": "<p>It is unknown of *Kulummu is a city and/or a kingdom in Tabal. It is mentioned only the Eponym Chronicle for the year 705 BC: \"<span>In the eponymy of Nas\u1e2bur-B\u0113l, governor of the city Amedi (705):\u00a0<span>The ki[ng ...]; against Gurd\u00ee, the Kulummian ... [...]. The king was killed (and) the camp of the king of Assyria [...]. Sennacherib [</span><em id=\"d2e8380\">became</em><span>]\u00a0</span><em id=\"d2e8383\">ki</em><span>[</span><em id=\"d2e8386\">ng</em><span>] in the month Abu (V), on the 12th day.\"</span></span></p>",
  "review_state": "published",
